# Console update/telemetry domains, blocked so a jailbroken PS4/PS5/Switch/Wii
# on the LAN can never reach the real vendor servers and auto-update or phone
# home. Domain list sourced from the DNS_Rules (Block + Redirect targets,
# collapsed to their base domains) in:
# https://github.com/Al-Azif/ps4-exploit-host/blob/master/settings.json
# adblock blocks the domain and every subdomain; one bare domain per line is
# enough, no wildcard syntax needed.
